  "text": "Skip to content\nD\nBeirut Pharmacy A (demo)\nApproved · closed now\nToday\nReservations\nInventory\nListings\nNotifications\nSettings\nLog out\nSettings\nOpening hours, pickup time and phone\nReservations already made keep the time their client was given.\nOpening hours\nMonday\nto\nto\nRemove\nTuesday\nto\nto\nRemove\nWednesday\nto\nto\nRemove\nThursday\nto\nto\nRemove\nFriday\nto\nto\nRemove\nSaturday\nto\nto\nRemove\nSunday\nClosed\nFor a pharmacy open until midnight, close at 00:00.\nHow long do you keep a reservation?\n1 day\n2 days\n3 days\nA client chooses a pickup day within this time. Not picked up: back to your stock.\nPhone\n\nA Lebanese number, for example 01 234 567. Clients may call it.\n\nSave\nWhen your boxes are listed\nYou decide when clients can see a box. A box is never listed with more than 180 days left.\nList my boxes by themselves\nWhen they have 180 days left or fewer\nWhen they have 90 days left or fewer\nWhen they have 60 days left or fewer\nWhen they have 30 days left or fewer\nNever: I list each box myself\nA box that is not listed stays private. When a client needs that medicine, DawaLink may ask you for one box: you say yes or no, and you set its price.\nSave this rule\nYour address and your place on the map\nIf your pharmacy moves, change them here. Clients see the new address at once, and our team then looks at the new pin.\nAddress\nDistrict\nAkkar\nAley\nBaabda\nBaalbek\nBatroun\nBeirut\nBint Jbeil\nBsharri\nChouf\nHasbaya\nHermel\nJbeil\nJezzine\nKeserwan\nKoura\nMarjeyoun\nMatn\nMiniyeh-Danniyeh\nNabatieh\nRashaya\nSidon\nTripoli\nTyre\nWest Beqaa\nZahle\nZgharta\nWhere is your pharmacy?\nTap the map to put the pin on your pharmacy. You can drag it. Our team checks it against your address.\n+\n−\n© OpenStreetMap contributors\nPut the pin at the centre of the map\nSave the new address\nYour details\nPharmacy name\nBeirut Pharmacy A (demo)\nLicence number\nDEMO-0001\nYour name and your licence were checked when you were approved. Only our team changes them: write to us if one is wrong.\nPassword\nCurrent password\nNew password\n\nYour other devices are logged out.\nA password needs: At least 10 characters (missing), A capital letter (A to Z) (missing), A small letter (a to z) (missing), A number (missing), A symbol, like ! ? @ # - (missing).\n\nAt least 10 characters\n(missing)\nA capital letter (A to Z)\n(missing)\nA small letter (a to z)\n(missing)\nA number\n(missing)\nA symbol, like ! ? @ # -\n(missing)\nChange my password",
